-Dismantled drilling BOP components</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T19:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-08T19:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed toolbox for commencing WL operations.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T19:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-08T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Hooked up local control to HMV and DHSV. Shifted valve on HMV quick dump. Removed cap on KVW and rigged up bleed off line/manifold. Checked for pressure and removed treecap.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T20:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-08T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed lid on WL hatch and came down with WL riser. Adjusted WL hatch a few inches to starboard due to clash with WL riser. Landed WL riser on top of XMT and made up quick union. Hooked up BOP and tested hoses / calibrated rams (function test) - ok.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-08T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up to flush cement line. Flushed line from cement unit to XMT with MEG taking returns through closed drain.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-08T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed line test to 30/200 bar 5/10 min against closed KWV. Obtained test &lt;1% drop 10 min. Bled off pressure to closed drain. Bled off pressure on production flowline and vented same for continued testing.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2009-03-08T23:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2009-03-09T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed cap on WL riser. Lined up and filled WL riser with MEG from cement unit. Filled riser until fluid returns through needle valve on riser cap.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
